","arrow":true,"points":[[22.975,-4],[23.6,-4],[23.6,-6.3],[6,-6.3],[6,-2.6],[6.4,-2.6]],"signal":"WA3W","labels":[{"text":"WA3W","at":[20,-6.3],"place":"below"}]}],"junctions":[[0.35,0],[1.75,3.4],[4.4,0],[4.4,1.7],[4.4,4],[4.4,-2.6],[4.8,-2.6],[12.9,-1.35],[16.3,0.05],[19,0.05],[11.55,-1.95],[11.35,-6.9],[6.2,-6.9],[11.35,-1.35],[16.9,6.95],[16.9,6.050000000000001],[16.9,4.7]],"control":[{"signal":"PCSrcW","points":[[-2.3,-0.7],[-2.3,-0.2]],"place":null,"anchor":"north east"},{"signal":"BranchTakenE","points":[[-1.3,-1.4],[-1.3,-0.6]],"place":null,"anchor":"north west"},{"signal":"StallF","points":[[-0.3,1.15],[-0.3,0.65]],"place":"above"},{"signal":"StallD","points":[[3.6,1.4],[3.6,0.9]],"place":"above"},{"signal":"FlushD","points":[[3.6,-1.4],[3.6,-0.9]],"place":"below"},{"signal":"RegSrcD","points":[[5.65,2.35],[5.65,1.93]],"place":"above","text":"RegSrcD0"},{"signal":"RegSrcD","points":[[5.65,-1.6],[5.65,-1.03]],"place":"below","text":"RegSrcD1"},{"signal":"RegWriteW","points":[[6.75,2.75],[6.75,2]],"place":"above"},{"signal":"ImmSrcD","points":[[7.3,-5.25],[7.3,-4.9]],"place":"below"},{"signal":"FlushE","points":[[11,-5.55],[11,-5.1]],"place":null,"anchor":"east"},{"signal":"ForwardAE","points":[[12.35,1.95],[12.35,1.55]],"place":"above"},{"signal":"ForwardBE","points":[[12.35,-3.4],[12.35,-2.15]],"place":"below"},{"signal":"ALUSrcE","points":[[13.9,-1.85],[13.9,-1.25]],"place":null,"anchor":"west"},{"signal":"ALUControlE","points":[[15.3,-2.5],[15.3,-0.75]],"place":"below"},{"signal":"BranchTakenE","points":[[17.7,4.8],[18.05,4.8]],"place":"right","label_at":"end"},{"signal":"MemWriteM","points":[[20.4,1.15],[20.4,0.75]],"place":null,"anchor":"west"},{"signal":"MemtoRegW","points":[[23.7,-1.55],[23.7,-1.05]],"place":null,"anchor":"north west"},{"signal":"Match_1E_M,Match_1E_W,Match_2E_M,Match_2E_W,Match_12D_E","points":[[3.9,-7.6499999999999995],[3.9,-8.1]],"place":null,"anchor":"east","text":"Match"},{"signal":"PCSrcD","points":[[5.6,-7.6499999999999995],[5.6,-8.1]],"place":null,"anchor":"east"},{"signal":"MemtoRegE","points":[[8,-7.6499999999999995],[8,-8.1]],"place":null,"anchor":"east"},{"signal":"PCSrcE","points":[[9.6,-7.6499999999999995],[9.6,-8.1]],"place":null,"anchor":"east"},{"signal":"BranchTakenE","points":[[12,-7.6499999999999995],[12,-8.1]],"place":null,"anchor":"east"},{"signal":"PCSrcM","points":[[13.6,-7.6499999999999995],[13.6,-8.1]],"place":null,"anchor":"east"},{"signal":"RegWriteM","points":[[15.6,-7.6499999999999995],[15.6,-8.1]],"place":null,"anchor":"east"},{"signal":"PCSrcW","points":[[17.2,-7.6499999999999995],[17.2,-8.1]],"place":null,"anchor":"east"},{"signal":"RegWriteW","points":[[19.2,-7.6499999999999995],[19.2,-8.1]],"place":null,"anchor":"east"},{"signal":"StallF","points":[[4,-8.9],[4,-9.35]],"place":"below","label_at":"end"},{"signal":"StallD","points":[[6.5,-8.9],[6.5,-9.35]],"place":"below","label_at":"end"},{"signal":"FlushD","points":[[9,-8.9],[9,-9.35]],"place":"below","label_at":"end"},{"signal":"FlushE","points":[[11.5,-8.9],[11.5,-9.35]],"place":"below","label_at":"end"},{"signal":"ForwardAE","points":[[14,-8.9],[14,-9.35]],"place":"below","label_at":"end"},{"signal":"ForwardBE","points":[[16.8,-8.9],[16.8,-9.35]],"place":"below","label_at":"end"}],"figures":{},"alt":"Pipelined ARM processor with full hazard handling, in five stages separated by pipeline registers. Fetch (IF): two next-PC multiplexers, the first choosing PCPlus4F or ResultW by PCSrcW, the second that or the branch target ALUResultE by BranchTakenE; the PC register, enabled unless StallF; a + 4 adder; the instruction memory. The Fetch/Decode register holds the instruction only, enabled unless StallD and cleared by FlushD; PCPlus4F passes it and enters the register file as PCPlus8D, its R15 input. Decode (ID): the fields Rn, Rm, Rd and Instr23:0 branch to the register-address multiplexers, the register file and Extend; Op, Funct and Rd go to the Control Unit, whose signals run along the top through the pipeline registers; Rd goes on as WA3D, the register a result will be written to. Execute (EX): two forwarding multiplexers choose each operand from the register file (00), ResultW (01) or ALUOutM (10) by ForwardAE and ForwardBE; the ALU source multiplexer; the ALU; above it the Cond Unit with the flags register FlagsE, which computes CondExE from CondE and the flags and writes the new flags back; four AND gates let PCSrcE, RegWriteE, MemWriteE and BranchE through only when CondExE is 1; the last gives BranchTakenE. Memory (MEM): the data memory. Writeback (WB): the result multiplexer, by MemtoRegW. Along the bottom, ResultW returns to the register file, the forwarding multiplexers and the PC; WA3W to the register file; ALUOutM to the forwarding multiplexers; ALUResultE to the PC. Below them, the Hazard Unit takes the match signals, MemtoRegE, BranchTakenE, PCSrcD to PCSrcW, RegWriteM and RegWriteW, and gives StallF, StallD, FlushD, FlushE, ForwardAE and ForwardBE. Control signals are dashed."}
